1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,040
What do you like about living in budapest and what is something that you don't enjoy.
住在布达佩斯，你喜欢什么，又不喜欢什么？

2
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:09,480
I really like that I can get to the den every day and just like have a walk along.
我喜欢每天都能到字幕写作 den 的地方，沿着那里走走。

3
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:14,949
Still mesmerized by the parliament oh my god I think budapest is gorgeous look at this place.
我依然被国会大厦迷住。天哪，我觉得布达佩斯太漂亮了，看看这里。

4
00:00:14,959 --> 00:00:19,790
And I come home every may and I'm here until september because I love it here.
每年五月我回到这里，待到九月，因为我很喜欢这里。

5
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:26,640
It's such a walkable livable city especially on on the other side on buddha it's just like a gorgeous place to hang out.
这座城市适合步行、适合生活，尤其是另一边字幕写作 buddha 的地方，很适合闲逛。

6
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:29,760
I like to have these deep conversations with hungarians and I think.
我喜欢和匈牙利人深入聊天，而且我觉得……

7
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:37,160
It's also similar polish people and the neighboring countries are always uh same with these deep authentic conversations.
波兰人和周边国家的人也很相似，总喜欢这种深入、真实的交流。

8
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:42,190
The similarity of our cultures for me it feels a bit like home.
我们的文化很相似，对我来说这里有点像家。

9
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:46,000
I felt in love when I arrived here I was supposed to say just for 3 months but like wow.
我刚来就爱上这里，本来只打算待三个月，结果，哇。

10
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,839
The city is beautiful I I really like it it's kind of also organized like the public transport works very well I think.
城市很美，我很喜欢。也挺有条理，我觉得公共交通运行得很好。

11
00:00:50,839 --> 00:00:56,519
I really like the fact that I'm just gen living in somewhere beautiful where I can meet a lot of international people.
我很喜欢住在一个漂亮的地方，还能认识很多来自不同国家的人。

12
00:00:56,519 --> 00:01:02,320
For me I think that was also the reason why I moved from russia I was feeling that like it's not enough for me.
我觉得这也是我离开俄罗斯的原因；当时总觉得那里对我来说还不够。

13
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:08,040
One thing that uh I will never get used probably is the people and the food these two things it's hard.
可能有两点我永远不习惯，就是这里的人和食物。这两点很难适应。

14
00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:16,040
We have such a bad self esteem as as a nation we feel that we birth so much less than the western countries for example.
说到民族整体，我们自尊心很低，总觉得自己比西方国家差很多。

15
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:19,959
And then we have all these jokes like you know like here in hungary everything is.
我们总开这样的玩笑：你知道，在匈牙利，什么都……

16
00:01:19,959 --> 00:01:24,920
And then if you go to germany or you go to france or it's so much better everywhere else where you go.
然后你去德国、法国，或者别的地方，总觉得哪里都好得多。

17
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:28,399
You know that we were not allowed to travel until like the end of the 80 s.
你知道，我们以前不被允许旅行，直到八十年代末左右。

18
00:01:28,399 --> 00:01:33,600
I think once a year and then you need to have like a special permit for that so it was not easy to travel.
我记得一年一次，而且得有特别许可，所以旅行很不容易。

19
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:38,839
And of course coming out of uh the eastern block was not not so possible.
而且，当时想离开东欧集团也不太可能。

20
00:01:38,839 --> 00:01:44,720
When people still complain like how things are usually think the western block which I found super funny.
现在人们抱怨事情时，通常会想到西方集团，这让我觉得很有意思。

21
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:46,160
Europe is not the word.
字幕这里是 europe is not the word，语意不清，像是在说欧洲并不是全部。

22
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:52,799
What I can get used to the language I'm sorry guys but hungarian I don't know I don't know what it is.
我适应不了的是语言。不好意思，匈牙利语，我不知道，我真不知道怎么回事。

23
00:01:52,799 --> 00:01:58,440
And I'm really good at languages so but hungarian is totally totally not my thing.
我其实很擅长语言，可匈牙利语完全不是我的强项。

24
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:07,360
I wish uh hungarian people would be a bit more open minded and tolerant but on the other hand I can understand where it comes from.
我希望匈牙利人更开放、更包容，但另一方面，也能理解这种态度的由来。

25
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:15,559
And we also sometimes have s similar issues this fear of unknown is also encouraged by propaganda.
我们有时也有类似的问题，这种对未知的恐惧也会被宣传助长。

26
00:02:15,559 --> 00:02:22,480
I know many hungarians from my generation who are open minded and who also don't like what's going on here.
我认识很多同代的匈牙利人，他们思想开放，也不喜欢这里正在发生的事。

27
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:28,800
The mid level is disappearing and there's many many poor people and super rich now.
中间阶层正在消失，如今有很多穷人和特别有钱的人。

28
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:31,720
I know a lot of people who don't really make and meat.
我认识很多人，他们难以维持生计；字幕写作 make and meat。

29
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:37,350
What do you miss the most about italy the food it is the most italian response of all time.
你最想念意大利什么？食物。这是有史以来最意大利式的回答了。

30
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:40,240
And a good coffee it's very hard to find here a very good coffee honestly.
还有好咖啡。说实话，在这里很难找到很好的咖啡。

31
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:44,000
In italy one euro you go in every bar you find a good coffee.
在意大利，一欧元，随便去一家酒吧都能喝到好咖啡。

32
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:47,470
Here you have to find like four or 5 to find a decent coffee.
这里你得花四五个才喝到像样的咖啡。

33
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:49,720
It's super expensive and I'm super annoyed.
太贵了，我特别烦。

34
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:58,439
Because sometimes I go to vienna and I have literally like the same lunch or dinner with the same price and vienna is still vienna is austria.
有时我去维也纳，同样的午餐或晚餐价格竟然一样；而维也纳毕竟是在奥地利。

35
00:02:58,439 --> 00:03:07,759
Every time when I go here to a nice place now I usually spend myself with a drink around like 40 which is pretty expensive for hungarians.
现在我在这里去一家好点的店，加一杯饮料，自己通常要花四十左右，这对匈牙利人挺贵。

36
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:13,600
It's been hard to make friends and connect to people I came here in 2018 for that 9 months period.
交朋友、与人建立联系挺难。我二〇一八年来这里，待了九个月。

37
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:20,999
I never had any hungarian friends honestly I try to connect with some people I play guitar I found some people in the dorm who play guitar.
我一直没交到匈牙利朋友。我试着和人交流，会弹吉他，也在宿舍找到会弹吉他的人。

38
00:03:20,999 --> 00:03:25,640
I tried to offer like let's do some stuff together but unfortunately it never worked.
我提出一起做点什么，但遗憾的是始终没成。

39
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:32,879
Even in the classroom I felt this like no one was interested in me or like no one was like oh who are you where did you come from etc.
甚至在教室里，我感觉没人对我感兴趣，没人问我是谁、从哪儿来之类的。

40
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:39,640
Because in turkey if there's an arasmus student in the class like everyone comes around like who are you like do you need anything how can we help you.
在土耳其，要是班里来了字幕写作 arasmus 的交流生，大家会围过来问，你是谁，需要什么，我们怎么帮你？

41
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:45,749
Kind of felt a bit lonely during that 9 months period I can say that my only hungarian friend is my wife.
那九个月我有点孤独。可以说，我唯一的匈牙利朋友就是妻子。

42
00:03:45,759 --> 00:03:49,720
So well it's good that she's your friend at least yeah we we we are very good friends.
好吧，至少她是你的朋友，这挺好。对，我们是很好的朋友。
